{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34758","headline":"览皮先辈盛制因作十韵以寄用伸欵仰 · 崔璐","name":"览皮先辈盛制因作十韵以寄用伸欵仰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"河岳挺灵异，星辰精气殊。\n在人爲英杰，与国作祯符。\n襄阳得奇士，俊迈真龙驹。\n勇果鲁仲由，文赋蜀相如。\n浑浩江海广，葩华桃李敷。\n小言入无间，大言塞空虚。\n几人游赤水，夫子得玄珠。\n鬼神争奥秘，天地惜洪鑪。\n既有曾参行，仍兼君子儒。\n吾知上帝意，将使居黄枢。\n好保千金体须爲万姓谟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔璐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34758.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34758","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}